WEBVTT

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.820
The monster king of the world of
darkness is the Dark Lord Shabranigdo.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.650
This Dark Lord, who still
sleeps in the far north...

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.190
...created five high-ranking Monsters.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:47.190
Among them, the one who loves war
most is Gaav, the Demon Dragon King...

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:51.160
...who's the ringleader behind what
happened in Atlas City and Seyruun.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.600
We can't just stand
by and let him do this.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:56.730
That's why we're off on a new
journey to find a magic power...

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:59.780
...which can stand
up to a high-level Monster.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.160
You can't escape from me!

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:24.170
So, Gaav himself finally
makes an appearance.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:27.070
In all the times we challenged
you, you never showed up.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:31.970
A challenge from YOU isn't
enough to bring me out here.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:35.410
But your being here in the
temple changes things.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:41.050
I see. In this temple, surrounded
by the Claire Bible manuscripts...

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:43.250
...Hellmaster won't see this!

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.160
Ah, I see now.
I was careless, wasn't I?

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:51.760
You don't want Lord
Hellmaster to see this...

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:56.600
...because he is your
greatest obstacle now!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.300
Demon Dragon King Gaav...

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:02.300
Hellmaster? One of the
five high-ranking Monsters...

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.400
...created by the
Dark Lord Shabranigdo!

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.470
Hellmaster Phibrizzo!

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:12.010
Gaav and Hellmaster... What do
those two higher-ups want with me?

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:16.380
Wait, does that
mean that Xellos is?!

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:20.760
Show some respect, Xellos.
That's LORD Gaav!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:23.020
Oh, forgive me.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.490
What's this all about?

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.720
Why is Hellmaster fighting Gaav?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:38.010
It's simple! Because I'm a traitor
who's turned against Shabranigdo!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.770
And with that damned
Shabranigdo gone for now...

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.510
...the one who is the
biggest obstacle to my plans...

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:46.280
...is that accursed Hellmaster!

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.880
Just as I thought.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.890
Still, you certainly have
changed your image...

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.390
...in the thousand years
since we've last seen you.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.890
Eh, Lord Demon Dragon King?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:59.090
Have I? You mean how I
used to be a lot more polite?!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.480
Now then, there are a few
things I need to ask you.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.710
What were Hellmaster's
orders to you?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.520
What was Phibrizzo up to?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.280
To learn why you were trying to...

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:28.520
...secretly gain control of Atlas
City and Seyruun, of course...

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:32.250
I know THAT!

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:37.570
That wasn't all, was it? I want
you to explain your behavior!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:41.730
What is Hellmaster up to by
having you follow this girl?!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.230
Well?!

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.180
Don't waste my time!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.870
I could always
just kill you right here!

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:54.080
Even saying that, Lord Hellmaster
didn't tell me all the details.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.450
Then now you die.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.360
Miss Lina?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.300
Hold it right there, Mister!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:15.570
GAAV FLARE!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:23.710
What sort of joke is that?

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:26.270
You... You saved me, Lina!

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:28.290
You think somebody can
just stand by doing nothing...

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.980
...while they see you bullying
someone weaker than you?!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.090
Bullying someone weaker than me?
You don't know, do you?

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.100
How powerful Xellos is.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.760
No one outside we five of
Shabranigdo's most trusted companions...

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.570
...was given power like he has!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.030
Oh, my. You don't have
to put it like that!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:52.070
Yeah. Xellos, you're a pretty
high-level Monster, aren't you?

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.040
Yeah...

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:56.080
Oops! The cat's out of the bag.
How typical of you, Lina.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:01.020
Well, never mind that, though.
What are we going to do?

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:04.950
You need to ask?! You're going
to be killed by me right now!

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.320
Once I do that, whatever that
damned Phibrizzo is up to...

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.450
...won't matter anymore!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.460
Exactly!

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.290
Saygram!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.570
So, you think it's
gonna be that easy?

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.130
I am far different from the Monsters
you've defeated up till now!

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.010
ELMEKIA LANCE!

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.470
You... BORE... ME!!!

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.640
We're running for it, Auntie!

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:36.710
Right!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.260
Saygram...

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.460
I shall be the one you'll fight.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.200
Never mind Atlas City!
Never mind Seyruun!

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.670
How DARE you
interfere with my plans!

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.180
Please, there's
no need to thank me.

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.140
I'll shut that smart-ass
mouth of yours forever!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.750
You're pretty strong, pal.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.250
Looks like this is it!

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:20.960
Gourry!

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.520
You okay, Lina?

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.590
Looks like you ran into
some old trouble again.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.700
It's not just Saygram!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.070
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King,
is here, too!

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:28.800
What?!

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.360
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King?!

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:33.870
Even with you all fighting together...

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.970
...you'll never be able
to defeat Lord Gaav!

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.040
BLAST ASH!!!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.130
If that won't work, then try this!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:50.990
DYNAST BRAS!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.500
You did it! That's a powerful one!
It had to work!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.470
Useless...

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:13.040
If he was just trying to distract me,
you alone would have been enough.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:17.990
But Hellmaster must have some
other purpose in mind for that girl!

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.620
Tell me what it is!

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:23.860
And I told you that Lord
Hellmaster didn't tell me that!

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:26.900
Really? But you must have
wondered about it, didn't you?

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:32.360
Didn't you want to know why
you were traveling with that girl?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:39.430
Yes, I thought I should know what
Lord Hellmaster's plan was as well!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:40.570
Oh?

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:43.240
But as I learned more
about these people...

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.610
...I realized to a large
extent what his plan was!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.980
Hmpf! You're a crafty one...

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:51.580
I believe... the objective of
Lord Hellmaster's plan is...

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.090
The objective is?

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.030
A secret.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.010
It's useless!

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:15.080
"Supreme King with the frozen soul!
Grant me the power of your icy rage!"

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.740
DYNAST BRAS!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.510
What?!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.950
It worked! Miss Lina, now!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.110
All right!

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.490
"Lord of Darkness
of the Four Worlds!"

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:34.260
"I call upon you! Grant me all
the power that you possess!"

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.290
"Darkness beyond twilight..."

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:39.570
"Crimson beyond blood that flows!
Buried in the flow of time..."

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.300
"ln thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:46.810
"Let all the fools who stand
in our way be destroyed..."

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.910
"...by the power you and I possess!"

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:54.080
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:12.240
There's no way he could
have survived that, could he?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.530
He couldn't have...

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.770
Saygram!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:20.540
Sadly for you, Lord Gaav
granted me some of his power.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:23.010
That's how I could withstand
a spell that powerful.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.480
Looks like you're all having
a tough battle, too.

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:27.280
Mr. Xellos!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.110
Xellos!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.990
I think now would be an excellent time
to think of an escape plan, don't you?

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.330
You think you can escape from me?

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.360
Gaav!

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.620
Mister Ultimate Bad News, huh?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.970
If a Dragon Slave amplified with
the talismen couldn't beat him...

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.440
...then I can still
try the Ragna Blade...

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.700
...but I'd only be able to
use it to get one of them.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.930
Which only leaves... the Giga Slave.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:57.510
No! The Giga Slave's
the one thing I can't use!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:01.950
It's all over...

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.020
Hold it!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.190
MARTINA?!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.900
MARTINA?!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:32.960
The worst possible person with
the worst possible timing shows up...

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.560
...at the worst possible time!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.670
Master Xellos!
I've come to save you!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:43.980
Miss Martina?

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.610
She's your responsibility, pal.
YOUR responsibility.

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:47.740
Master Xellos!

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.880
Ooh!
Why'd she have to show up?

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.600
Master Xellos!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:01.990
Master Xellos, you're hurt!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.870
Master Xellos! Now that I, Martina
Xoana Mel Navrachoa, have arrived...

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:12.570
...you have nothing
to worry about!

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:15.340
What do you think your
coming here will accomplish?!

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:16.950
You need to ask?

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:20.110
I'm going to drive these characters
away, one, two, three!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:22.880
Now look! Do you know
who this guy is here?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.480
He's Gaav, the Demon Dragon King!

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.150
What's that?

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.750
Gaav's one of the most
powerful of all Monsters!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.960
He's really strong!
You can't do anything to...

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:35.630
Oh, would you listen to me?!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:36.670
Anyway...

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.800
I don't care if your
name's Gaav or Gutter...

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.030
AGH! Where are you going?!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:48.540
...in the end, you are no match
for the monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:50.080
Now get out of here!

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:52.170
AGH! Don't CHALLENGE him!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:54.910
Is your little comedy routine over?

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:59.490
I don't know what you're planning, but
I'll show you no mercy, young lady.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:05.860
N- Now taste the curse of...
the monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.830
Zoamelgustar?
Which Dark Lord is that?!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:12.800
Lord Zoamelgustar, please!
Lord Zoamelgustar, please!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:15.530
Uh-oh!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.040
Amelia, cover us!

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:17.940
Right!

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.510
Lord Zoamelgustar! Lord Zoamelgustar!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:23.100
Martina, RUN!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.980
Lord Zoamelgustar, SAVE ME!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:34.590
What?!

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:45.830
Wh- What's going on?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.740
This is the divine protection
of Lord Zoamelgustar!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.470
- Is it?
- How should I know?!

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:55.380
Whatever it is, let's use it!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.240
Everyone! Use Martina
as a shield and run!

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:00.240
Right!

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:04.920
Hold it! Hold it!

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.490
You won't escape!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.190
Hold it! Hold it!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:17.890
Wow...

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.310
Something awfully BIG
is headed for us!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.190
Just leave it to me!

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:43.360
Huh?! What's wrong!
Come on! Work! Huh?!

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:44.760
What are you doing?!

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.300
I wish I knew!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.790
Miss Lina!

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.850
Hmpf! Looks like I won't
be needed any longer!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.560
Lord Zoamelgustar-r-r-r!!!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.570
Auntie!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.560
So, it's come to this, has it?

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:34.480
You want to interfere,
Water Dragon King?!

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.070
Water Dragon King?

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.710
Don't be too impressed, dear.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:42.020
All I am are the remaining
thoughts of the Water Dragon King...

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:45.610
...after he died in the
battle 1000 years ago.

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:47.120
Th- Then...

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:52.150
Yes. I'm merely an illusion
created by the manuscript's power.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:53.490
Auntie!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.430
Ma'am, look out!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.370
Listen to me!
When you leave this place...

00:15:57.440 --> 00:16:01.200
...head for the Katahto mountains,
where the original Claire Bible is!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:03.710
Wh- What did you say?!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:04.770
Auntie!

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:08.610
I wasn't much help, I'm afraid,
but I'll do what I can.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.210
AUNTIE!!!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.580
I owe you for this,
Water Dragon King...

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:44.310
What just happened?

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:47.350
I think the old woman
transported us out of there.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.920
Auntie...

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:52.580
When you leave this place,
head for the Katahto mountains.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:55.250
Where the original Claire Bible is!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:00.690
The Katahto mountains...
The original Claire Bible...

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.200
WHAT?! A Monster?!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.430
M- Master Xellos is a Monster?!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:10.000
Well, I'm afraid it's true.

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:12.510
Oh, no...

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.410
You lied to me!
I'll never love anyone again!

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.550
Looks like it was
a real shock for her.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.820
I'll say!
Miss Lina, did you know?

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.220
Well... Sorta.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.310
I hate when you do that.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.380
But why does Mr. Xellos
have to be a Monster?

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:29.860
It's not too late!

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:33.920
End your evil ways as a
Monster and become a real human!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.260
Um, even if you ask...

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:40.770
Come on, it's not like Xellos
WANTED to be born a Monster.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.730
Mr. Gourry, what are you saying?!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.540
Monsters are the natural
enemy of all who live!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.240
They cause terrible
damage for no reason!

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:51.340
And to think we've been
traveling with one!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:56.450
Please, don't say that!
I'm not as bad as...

00:17:56.620 --> 00:18:00.750
But I figured out that Xellos
was a Monster a long time ago.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.320
Uh, Gourry... Are you sure
you're thinking straight?

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:06.760
Animal instinct, I guess...

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:10.170
Look, even if you say that, you
figured it out, too. Right, Lina?

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:13.570
Well, after Xellos dropped
his act in front of me.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:17.100
So? Are you up to something or not?

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:21.970
From what I can figure out,
Gaav, the Demon Dragon King...

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:24.480
...has turned against the Monster
Race for some reason, and Xellos...

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:26.780
...was sent out to keep him
from expanding his power.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:30.480
Then that means that what happened
in Atlas City and Seyruun...

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:34.580
...were part of Gaav's attempts
at expanding his power.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.950
Bingo! Exactly right!

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:41.260
And it looks like Hellmaster
has a plan of his own, too.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:43.930
And as I said before,
that's a secret.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.300
Why, you!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.200
Stop it!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.500
Why should I stop?!

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:50.540
Because Xellos is powerful!
More than anyone here is!

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:51.440
What?!

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:53.710
If he wasn't a
really powerful Monster...

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.680
...then Gaav never would
have come out here himself!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:00.350
But he got beaten to a pulp
when he fought Gaav!

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:04.550
What were you thinking, picking
a fight when you're so weak?!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.650
It just means you
don't know yourself!

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:10.890
No matter how good you think you are,
you still got your butt kicked, right?!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.520
It wasn't my fault...

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:16.300
I think it just shows how
powerful Gaav really is.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.340
So, are we going to
continue this journey?

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.600
Well, it's obvious Xellos's
pals are up to something...

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:25.270
...but he doesn't feel like
telling us what, right?

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:26.640
Of course.

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:29.740
Mr. Xellos, it's not fair for
you to just play dumb with us!

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:32.410
If you won't tell us
what's going on, then...

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.420
...I know how to fix you!

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:36.180
Oh? How?

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:39.220
From now on, every night,
you have to repeat...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.760
..."Life is wonderful!
Life is wonderful!"

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.930
And keep right on repeating it!

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.330
Um... Don't you
think that's a little...

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:50.800
Since you Monsters thrive
on anti-life feelings...

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:54.600
...then praising life will
have an effect on you!

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.230
That would affect anyone,
not just Monsters.

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:01.400
So, Lina,
what are you gonna do?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:05.010
Well, I may not know
exactly what they're up to...

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.540
...but I've come too
far to run away now.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:11.750
I wouldn't want to run, either,
after coming this far.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.360
In any case, we have to find
a power to use against Gaav...

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:19.190
...and whatever other Monsters
there are as fast as we can!

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.130
You mean?!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.290
Yeah. We're going
where the old woman...

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.840
...said we'd find
the original Claire Bible.

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.770
To the Katahto mountains.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.570
I agree.

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.110
That okay with you, Xellos?

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:30.830
Yes!

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:35.670
So, unless somebody has a better idea,
we're going to the Katahto mountains!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:36.650
Yeah!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:40.050
But, before we do, let's have
some fun and eat something!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:41.640
Hey, Mister! Menus, please!

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.050
I knew this would happen...

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:44.610
Oh, menus are too much trouble!

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.250
Just bring us ten servings each of
everything from the top row on down!

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.950
Life is wonderful...

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.890
Life is...
